---
import InformationLayout from '@/layouts/InformationLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '@/config/site';
---

<InformationLayout title="Terms & Conditions" description="Website use, admission enquiries, published fees, external services, and contact information for M.P. Public School, Indore." updated>
  <h2>Website purpose</h2>
  <p>This website provides information about {siteConfig.fullName}, {siteConfig.address}, and lets parents and guardians contact the school. Use it lawfully and provide accurate information when making an enquiry.</p>

  <h2>School information and admissions</h2>
  <p>Admission enquiries are requests for information. They do not reserve a seat, guarantee admission, or establish enrolment. The school office confirms availability, eligibility, subject options, documents, and the steps applicable to your child's class and session.</p>
  <p>Published timetables, fees, and documents relate to the session named on the page or document. Confirm current details with the school before making arrangements or paying. Academic results describe past performance, not a promise of future outcomes.</p>

  <h2>Fees and payments</h2>
  <p>The website shows the published tuition schedule and separate new-admission charges. Transport and other applicable costs must be confirmed separately. Obtain a written fee breakdown and the applicable concession terms from the office.</p>
  <p>This website does not collect fees or offer online checkout. Arrange payments with the school office and obtain a receipt. Read the <a href="/refund-policy">cancellation and refund information</a> and request the applicable written policy before paying.</p>

  <h2>Forms and external services</h2>
  <p>Enquiry forms submit to Google Forms, and the browser opens Google's response page. External services such as Google Maps, WhatsApp, and social platforms have their own terms and privacy practices. See our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> for the services used by this website.</p>

  <h2>Website material</h2>
  <p>School branding and supplied content belong to their respective owners. You may read and download published school documents for personal school-related use. Contact the school for permission before reproducing student images, results, or other school material.</p>

  <h2>Corrections and enquiries</h2>
  <p>If you find inaccurate information, a broken page, or a problem submitting an enquiry, contact <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`}>{siteConfig.email}</a> or <a href={`tel:${siteConfig.phones[0].replace(/\s/g, '')}`}>{siteConfig.phones[0]}</a>. Please identify the page and describe the problem. Updates to these website terms will be posted here. Nothing on this page removes rights available under applicable law.</p>
</InformationLayout>
